  "body": "With the advent of VR and AR devices, we have browsers that can live in a 3 dimensional virtual space. To enhance the experience, we want to give sites the ability to specify 3D models instead of flat images for their favicons. \r\n\r\nWe created an explainer [here](https://github.com/immersive-web/spatial-favicons/blob/master/explainer.md) and discussed it with the web manifest group (see [this issue](https://github.com/w3c/manifest/issues/763)).\r\n\r\n@zcorpan What do we need to do to get an extra value in the sizes array?",
